1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:03,200
您好，我是赵海英律师。
Hello. I am Zhao Haiying, an attorney at law.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,110
兰台（上海）律师事务所高级合伙人，从业至今已有十八年。
I am a senior partner at Lantai (Shanghai) Law Firm and have practiced law for 18 years.

3
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:14,000
我本人主要从事涉外法律服务。
My practice focuses on cross-border legal services.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,110
主要为海外华侨、外籍人士以及跨境企业处理涉及中国的法律事务。
I primarily assist overseas Chinese, foreign nationals and cross-border businesses with matters involving China.

5
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:27,000
我的业务范围包括涉外继承，境内房产和资产的处置。
My practice covers cross-border inheritance and the disposal of property and other assets in China.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,110
处置以后的资金跨境汇出、外商投资、跨境婚姻家事，以及涉外刑事法律辩护业务。
It also covers cross-border remittance after disposal, foreign investment, cross-border family matters and criminal defense for foreign nationals.

7
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:42,000
跨境法律事务往往涉及当事人的身份认定和法律关系认定。
Cross-border matters often require determining a person's status and the applicable legal relationships.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,110
也涉及不同国家和地区的法律差异，以及境内外文件的准备和法律程序。
They also involve differences among jurisdictions, as well as the preparation of documents and legal procedures in China and abroad.

9
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:54,500
我注重从客户的实际需求出发，梳理法律关系。
I start with the client's practical needs and clarify the relevant legal relationships.

10
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:59,110
识别潜在风险，寻找合法可行的解决路径。
I then identify potential risks and look for lawful, workable solutions.

11
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:05,000
我相信，好的法律服务不只是解释法律。
I believe good legal services involve more than explaining the law.

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,110
更重要的是帮助客户理清复杂的法律难题，让解决方案真正落到实处。
They should help clients untangle complex legal problems and turn solutions into practical results.

13
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:15,000
我是赵海英律师。
I am Zhao Haiying.

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,110
如果您有涉及中国的跨境法律事务，欢迎与我联系。谢谢。
If you have a cross-border legal matter involving China, please contact me. Thank you.
